      "description": "當前題目保持 aria-current；窄螢幕轉水平題目列。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"市政題目\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link ds-current\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#shade\"><span class=\"ds-number\">01</span><span>樹蔭公平</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#bins\"><span class=\"ds-number\">02</span><span>清潔箱配置</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif;display:grid;gap:3px;background:#19382f;color:#eff5ec;padding:18px}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 10px;border-radius:3px;min-height:48px;font-size:14px;color:#bdd0c4}.ds-number{font-size:12px;opacity:.8;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-nav-link:hover{background:#27493d}.ds-nav-link.ds-current{background:#e3ebdc;color:#213b33;font-weight:600}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d5a450;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:900px){.ds-nav{display:flex;overflow:auto;gap:4px}.ds-nav-link{white-space:nowrap;min-height:44px;font-size:13px}}@media(max-width:850px){.ds-nav-link{gap:6px}}"
    },
    {
