      "refersTo": "evidence-badge",
      "description": "非互動文字，說明真實點位與假設情境。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-evidence\">真實樹木點位 × 假設植栽情境</span>",
      "css": ".ds-evidence{font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;white-space:normal;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #d4dfcc;background:#eaf0e1;border-radius:3px;color:#486244;line-height:1.6;max-width:270px}@media(max-width:1180px){.ds-evidence{display:inline-block;max-width:none;margin-top:14px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "主要視角切換",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "同一組參數及結果的地圖、3D、圖表按鈕組；僅示範實際狀態樣式。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-views\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"情境視角\"><button class=\"ds-view\" aria-pressed=\"true\">街道地圖</button><button class=\"ds-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\">3D 情境</button><button class=\"ds-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\">比較圖表</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-views{display:flex;gap:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#cbd5c9)}.ds-view{font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;background:transparent;min-height:48px;padding:10px 16px;flex:1;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink,#213b33)}.ds-view[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e3ebdc;color:#19382f;border-color:#39835f}.ds-view:hover{background:#e9ede3}.ds-view:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d5a450;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-view{padding:10px 8px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "主要畫面細框",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "visual-panel",
      "description": "比較圖表的主要容器；此 snippet 不模擬模型或繪圖。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-visual\"><div class=\"ds-visual-heading\"><h2>基準與方案比較</h2><span>相同情境參數</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-visual{font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif;background:#fffefa;color:var(--ink,#213b33);border:1px solid var(--line,#cbd5c9);border-radius:4px;box-shadow:none;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;margin:0}.ds-visual-heading{padding:16px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.ds-visual-heading h2{font-size:17px;margin:0;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}.ds-visual-heading span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted,#526359)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "3D 局部控制表面",
